meta {
  name: Categories
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/categories
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The Plaid PFC v2 taxonomy (~127 codes), grouped by primary - 18 groups,
  each an { id, name } pair carrying a detailed[] array of { id, name }
  leaves. pfcv1Detailed (the sync-side v1→v2 mapping) never appears here;
  it's not display data, and neither is Plaid's own icon URL or prose
  description - name and primaryName are curated, not Plaid's (see
  lib/category-names.ts). Static seed data, no filters, no pagination.
}
